# Emergency tenant data exports (PII) — never commit (S8)
exports/

# Claude Code agent worktrees — transient, auto-cleaned, ~34M each.
# These are full working copies an isolated agent branches into; committing one
# would vendor the entire repo into itself. Only the agent's COMMITS matter, and
# those land on a real branch. Scoped to worktrees/ deliberately: anything else
# under .claude/ (settings, skills, agent definitions) is project config and
# should stay committable.
.claude/worktrees/
